# Fetichism (Bastok 1-3): begun and finished in Bastok Markets. A level 10 Warrior of Bastok holding the four Quadav
# Fetich parts (1-1 and 1-2 completed by a GM; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Cleades: section 1: 1001, finished
# with 2: Bastok Markets' own handleAcceptMission registration: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Section 2:
# ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6; one part: no match, no event; the four: 1008, finished (completed, parts taken). The
# mission current again (a GM), the parts given again: 1005, finished: Bastok Markets' 1005 handler.
# Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West
# onZoneIn, which returns 22 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1005 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1008
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
login
trigger Cleades                         # section 1: 1001
finish option=2                         # 2: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Cleades                         # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
walk -357,-10,-168
trade Cleades QuadavFetichHead x1       # one part: no event
trade Cleades QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1008
finish                                  # completed; the parts taken
mission Bastok Fetichism current        # a GM
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
trade Cleades QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1005
finish                                  # completed again
